+/* Classic-API replacements for getaddrinfo/getnameinfo/freeaddrinfo/gai_strerror.
+ * WinUAE's bsdsocket emulation and AmiTCP-era stacks lack the Roadshow-era
+ * getaddrinfo family (calling them faults with a 68k Address Error), so
